    "<DIV STYLE=\"text-align:Left;\"><DIV><DIV><P><SPAN>Census Tract (CT) level data from the 2021 Census Program. Includes most of the information released as part of the Complete Profiles for the Age, Gender, and Dwelling Types release. Due to the complexity of the data, changes were made to the field names in order to accommodate the limitations of the database. This makes some uses harder as it requires careful use of the field names and totals to provide accurate values and analysis.</SPAN></P><P><SPAN>Note: The 2021 Census now provides release information by gender, rather than sex at birth.</SPAN></P></DIV></DIV></DIV>"
